  "description": "Black and yellow provide a clear contrast for optional varsity personalization. The black body and yellow sleeves establish the proposed color placement. This is a custom design starting point; check the measurements, decoration placement and final construction before ordering. Any lettering shown is generic sample personalization.\n\nDetails\n- Body: Black melton wool\n- Sleeves: Yellow cowhide leather\n- Collar: ribbed stand collar\n- Cuffs and waistband: black with yellow stripes\n- Lining: lining specification to be confirmed before production\n- Closure: front snaps\n- Fit: unisex regular\n\nCustomization options\nDiscuss a chenille letter, name, number, year patch or embroidery for suitable areas. Placement depends on the selected construction. Confirm the final artwork, size and colors before production. Use your own approved personalization details when requesting a finished design.",
